<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NAM" style="id">Nahum</book>
  <para style="h">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nahum</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nahum</para>
  <para style="mt">Nahum</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi thu in Nineveh taw kisai thu hi a, Elkosh khua mi Nahum ii mukholna thu khat tepteena ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa Pathian in ama a demte kuama dual ngawl hi; ama in ama a nalhte daan pia hi. A thin uukna taw amate thuk kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa thin uuk papaih ngawl a, ahihang ama vaanglian in a maw a khial te daan pia ngawlin tha thong ngeingawl hi. Topa paina munah vuipi suangval va a; meeite sia a peang taw a sina pan a leang leivui khute ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in tuipi thupia a, tuasia kang hi! Ama in ngunte kosak ngiungeu hi. Bashan lote vulin, Carmel mual sia ang a, tuaciang Lebanon paakte vul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa mai ah mualpite liingin kektham a; ama mai ah mualnote tuitham hi. Topa a kilangh ciang leitung kilok a; leitung le a mite theampo liing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama a thin uuk ciang akua nungta zo lai tu ziam? A lauhuai mama a thinsona ah akua nungta zo nawn tu ziam? A thin uukna meikuang tha suk a; suangte tamhthamin ama ii mai ah leivui suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa pha hi; ngimna hun sungah a mite sungsia hi; Ama kung a zuante ama in keamthiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipawm lian khat bangin a ngalte sucip a; ama a nalhte thina thuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa langpan in bang vawt sawm nu ziam? Ama in no hong susia tu hi. Kuama in khatvei kaan ama nalh ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lingngui kivialte le taangphaw ko bangin no zukhamte hong kihaltum tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nineveh awng, ngitlo vai vive a tum, Topa langpan a sawm khat na kung pan hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hisia in Israel a mite tungah Topa ii cina hi; “Assyria te hat in mihing tam napi amate kisusia a bo tu hi. Ka mite awng, note kong thuaksak a, ahizong tuabangin kong vawt kik buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu in note tungah Assyria vaangletna ka bosak tu a, hong heenna thikkhaute ka sutan tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hisia in Assyria te taw kisai Topa thutanna hi: “Amate min a zomto tu in suan le paal nei ngawl tu hi. Amate ii pathiante biakinnte sungah a om milimte ka susia tu hi. Assyria te atu in thaankuul khat ka vawtkhol tu hi — amate a nungta tu in kilawm ngawl uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />En vun, thupha puak kamtai khat mualtung tawnin hong pai hi! Ama in zawna taangko tu in hong pai ahi hi! Judah mite awng, na poaipi khaam vun a, Pathian tungah ciliap huai takin, na kamciam sate pia vun. Mi ngilote in na ngam uh hong sim ngei nawn ngawl tu hi. Amate kisusia diipdeap zo hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nineveh awng, nang hong kisim hi! Nang hong vaat tham tu vaangletna hong pai zo hi. Ngalnan natu te kinging vun! Lampi cing vun! Ngalsim tu in kithoai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />(A ngalte ii sutol ma hun lai bangin Topa in Israel mite ii a minthanna pia kik dektak hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngalte ii ngalkapte in lumsante toai a, a kibang puansante silh hi. Amate ngalsim tu in kithoai hi! a ngalleangte meikuang bangin tee vazak hi! A siphute pai nuamin a peang laam zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lampite kaantanin siphu ngalleangte tai kheukho a, khuapi khawlmunte kaantan in kinuntaw kawkoai hi. Amate mei lomsawm det te bangin taang vazak a, khualeng bangin peak kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngalkap bute kisam a; maisang a phul ciang amate lutu uh hi. A simte in khuapi uumna luphung sangah tai a lumte taw kidalin, kulh sukthapna moltumte bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngunhui a kongpite kihong keak a; kumpi inn sia launa taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpinu kiman a; a naseamte vakhu kuul bangin kap uh hi; khuangai in a awm beang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A cimhtham tui cimna khat pan tuiluang bangin Nineveh pan mihingte taikeak uh hi! “Tawlnga vun! Tawlnga vun!” ci in khuapi pan aw nging hi — ahizong kuama heak kik ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngunnte phuul vun! Khamhte phuul vun! Khuapi sia sumngum taw kidim hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nineveh sia kisusia in, kinusia a, ngamkhing hi! Launa taw thin tamhtham a; khupte liingin, a thahatna bo hi; maitangte daang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tawpite ii kua khat taw a kibang, tawpi note kivaakna mun, tawpital le tawpipui vana, a note ngammuangin a omna tua khuapi sia tu in koi sungah om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tawpi in a neak tu sa manin a pui le a note atu balneen a; ama in akua sia sabekte taw dimh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa Vaanglianbelpa in, “Keima in na ngalpa ka hi hi! Na siphu leangte haltum tu khi hi. Na ngalkapte ngal sungah kithatlum tu a, midangte tung pan na laakte theampo hong laaksak tu khi hi. Na palaite ii ngetnate kiza nawn ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kitheamna, mi kithalupna, sutol tu le phuul tu bek ahi hauna taw a kidim khuapi a lal hi zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nganno saatna a nging, leangmui nging, Siphu kitawte khuasuan nging, siphu ngalleang kithinna awnging te ngai vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siphu ngalkapte kidel a, namsaute tee vazal in, teite nizang la vazial hi! Mithiluangte vum vinvun in kiseng a, mithiluangte sim zawk ngawlin om a — tuate tungah mihingte lutu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pumpi zuak ahi Nineveh sia daan kipia hi. Dei huai in thina piangsak thei ai taw kidim a, ama in minamte ai taw zol in sal suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa Vaanglianbelpa in, “Daan kong pia tu hi, Nineveh awng! Na pumnguak kong koi tu a, ngam tuatuamte in kong musak tu hi, na maizum huaina theampo hong mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang kong zawnsak vawt tu a, a kiihuai ninteak taw kong siin tu hi. Mihingte lau in nang hong salh tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang hong mu po nungkin kik tu hi, Amate in, ‘Nineveh sia zaancip zo hi! Akua in ama hesuakhuai sa ziam? Akua in ama heeneam nuam tu ziam?’ ci tu uh hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nineveh awng, nang sia Egypt khuapi Thebes, sangin phazaw ni ziam? Ama zongh pang bangin a dal tu ngun khat nei hi — Nile ngun sia ama kidalna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in Ethiopia le Egypt uk hi, ama ii vaangletna ciangtan om ngawl hi; Libya sia ama kipawlpui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahitazong Thebes mite salin kipaipui veve hi. Lampi king sim ah a patangte kivellum hi. A lampuite thikkol bul sa in kipaipui a, a mante kihawmhsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nineveh awng, nang zongh zu khamin na puk tu hi: Nang zongh na ngalte kung pan suatak natu na hanciam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kulhte theampo sia thei min kungte bang hi tu a: theikungte thing vun, tua hile a nga na kam sung tatak ah taak tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ngalkapte sia numeite bang hi a, na ngalte mai ah na ngam sia ngalnanna sel hi. Na kongpi kilhnate meikuang in lalsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngalte hong uumci tu kingin kholna in tui toai vun a, na kulhpite ciangthua in khosak vun! Uksuang seak natu in buan cil vun a, uksuang bekna kuang a kinging sa in koi vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangpo na vawt zong hong kihallum veve tu hi, ahibuale ngal sungah hong kithatlum veve tu hi. Khaumaw te ii lo ante a khawn tum bangin note hong kimaimot tu hi. Khaumawte bangin na pung uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Van a aksite sangin a tamzaw sumvawtte na piangsak hi! Ahizong tu in tuate a tha phalhin a leang khaumawte bangin thot zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na uliante sia khuatuap ni in pang tung a bok khaumaw honkhat bang ahi uh hi. Ahizong ni hong sua ciang amate leang vingveng in, a zotna mun kuama in he ngawl hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Assyria kumpilianpa awng, na ngamuk mangte thi uh hi, na kumpi uliante a tawntung mutthip uh hi! Na mite mualtung tengah kithethaang a, a inn ah a ciapui kik tu kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na liam nate bawl natu bangma om ngawl a, na liammate kidamsak thei ngawl hi. Na lalna thu a za theampo in lungdam in a khutbeang uh hi. Na khealmawk ngitlona uh pan, a suakta akua om na ziam?
  </para>
</usx>
